---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
import PageHeader from "@components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Layout title="California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Notice">
  <PageHeader label="Legal / CCPA" title="California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Notice" />
  <Container>
    <div class="prose py-12">
      <p>
        <strong>Last updated: November 4, 2026.</strong> AI Hub is a personal, non-commercial site. Whether or not the California Consumer Privacy Act applies to it, California residents can use the rights below. The <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> has the full details.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. What's collected</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Identifiers:</strong> name and email address, if you send a form.</li>
          <li><strong>Internet activity:</strong> pages visited and browser and device details, through Google Analytics.</li>
          <li><strong>Approximate location:</strong> estimated by Google Analytics. The site doesn't collect precise location.</li>
          <li><strong>Other information you choose to send:</strong> the content of your message or prompt.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Your rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Know what personal information I hold about you.</li>
          <li>Ask me to correct or delete it.</li>
          <li>Be treated the same for using these rights.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Selling and sharing</h2>
        <p>
          I don't sell personal information or share it for targeted advertising, so there's nothing to opt out of. The site doesn't knowingly collect information from children under 16.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. How to make a request</h2>
        <p>
          Use the <a href="/#contact">contact form</a> and say what you'd like me to do. I may need to confirm the request is yours, for example by replying to the email address you submitted with.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
